==== Wave 1: Graphics

Wave 1 is where the world you fly over starts to matter — long legs over real terrain deserve to look real. Visual mods here are allowed as long as they stay cosmetic.

The foundational toolset already covers the big one: *AutoOrtho* (photoreal ground, see the Foundational chapter) is at home in this wave's cross-country legs.

One visual addition was made at your direction on 2026-08-21 — the sky a long cross-country leg is flown through.

